        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>So now we know that every character in Prime War either comes from a destroyed universe, or was lost in time and space (or similar).&nbsp; I get the impression that this is connected to C&amp;A's insistence that the characters who left Universe One via a Mist Portal didn't necessarily make it back home.&nbsp; So it's possible that the Inversiverse is gone (since Black Frost is displaced), but Princess Luminary is still out there somewhere.&nbsp; Same goes for Supply &amp; Demand Benchmark.&nbsp; There's also the Ahoraverse (Night Terror and Disparation Dark Watch), and I don't think we know what universe Windwalker is from.</p>",
