        "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:38:21.553Z",
        "cooked": "<p>First appearance of Nimbus, my favorite other letter writer, even though  believe he wrote an earlier level with a different name and the later tagline “Lord of the Heavens, Master of the Wind and Sky”.  When the name and tagline combine, they become such a cool character byline that I wish there was an actual deck for it.</p>\n<p>Christopher and Adam and Cody and AJ and Ryan reading letters to you.  Doesn’t have quite the same ring to it.</p>",
